+        Args:
+            http_request: callable, a callable that matches the method
+                          signature of httplib2.Http.request, used to make the
+                          refresh request.
+
+        Raises:
+            HttpAccessTokenRefreshError: When the refresh fails.
+        """
+        if not self.store:
+            self._do_refresh_request(http_request)
+        else:
